<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Personal Health — Wellness</title>
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@400;500;600;700;800&family=JetBrains+Mono:wght@400;600&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/public/css/tokens.css">
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/public/css/wellness.css">
  <script src="/config.js"></script>
</head>
<body>

  <aside class="sidebar">
    <div class="logo">
      <span class="logo-mark">PH</span>
      <span class="logo-name">Personal Health</span>
    </div>
    <nav class="nav">
      <a class="nav-item" href="/">Overview</a>
      <a class="nav-item" href="/dashboard">Dashboard</a>
      <a class="nav-item active" href="/wellness">Wellness</a>
      <a class="nav-item" href="/map">Map</a>
    </nav>
    <div class="sidebar-status">
      <span class="dot <%= backendOnline ? 'green' : 'red' %>"></span>
      <span><%= backendOnline ? 'Backend online' : 'Backend offline' %></span>
    </div>
  </aside>

  <main class="main">
    <div class="page-header">
      <div>
        <h1>Wellness</h1>
        <p class="sub">Nutrition, sleep &amp; recovery tracking</p>
      </div>
      <a href="/dashboard" class="btn">Back to Dashboard</a>
    </div>

    <!-- PH-V2-F-07: 2x2 preview tiles instead of single coming-soon -->
    <div class="wellness-preview-grid">
      <div class="preview-tile ph-stagger ph-stagger-1">
        <div class="preview-pill">Coming Soon</div>
        <div class="preview-icon-box">
          <svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M3 3v18h18"/><path d="M18.4 14.2l-3.4-3.4-3 3-4-4"/></svg>
        </div>
        <h3>Nutrition Tracking</h3>
        <p>Log meals from a 200+ Indian food database with calorie and macro tracking.</p>
        <div class="preview-mock">
          <div class="mock-row"><span>Poha</span><span class="tabular">270 cal</span></div>
          <div class="mock-row"><span>Dal Rice</span><span class="tabular">420 cal</span></div>
          <div class="mock-row"><span>Paneer Tikka</span><span class="tabular">280 cal</span></div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="preview-tile ph-stagger ph-stagger-2">
        <div class="preview-pill">Coming Soon</div>
        <div class="preview-icon-box">
          <svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M21 12.79A9 9 0 1 1 11.21 3 7 7 0 0 0 21 12.79z"/></svg>
        </div>
        <h3>Sleep Quality</h3>
        <p>Track bedtime, duration, and sleep score with weekly trends.</p>
        <div class="preview-mock">
          <div class="sleep-bars">
            <div class="bar" style="height: 60%"></div>
            <div class="bar" style="height: 80%"></div>
            <div class="bar" style="height: 70%"></div>
            <div class="bar" style="height: 90%"></div>
            <div class="bar" style="height: 50%"></div>
            <div class="bar" style="height: 75%"></div>
            <div class="bar" style="height: 85%"></div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="preview-tile ph-stagger ph-stagger-3">
        <div class="preview-pill">Coming Soon</div>
        <div class="preview-icon-box">
          <svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"/><path d="M12 6v6l4 2"/></svg>
        </div>
        <h3>Recovery Score</h3>
        <p>Pre-session readiness based on sleep, soreness, and stress.</p>
        <div class="preview-mock">
          <div class="recovery-ring">
            <div class="ring-bg"></div>
            <div class="ring-value tabular">74</div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="preview-tile ph-stagger ph-stagger-4">
        <div class="preview-pill">Coming Soon</div>
        <div class="preview-icon-box">
          <svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M21 16V8a2 2 0 0 0-1-1.73l-7-4a2 2 0 0 0-2 0l-7 4A2 2 0 0 0 3 8v8a2 2 0 0 0 1 1.73l7 4a2 2 0 0 0 2 0l7-4A2 2 0 0 0 21 16z"/></svg>
        </div>
        <h3>Hydration</h3>
        <p>Daily water intake tracking with reminders.</p>
        <div class="preview-mock">
          <div class="hydration-bar">
            <div class="hydration-fill" style="width: 65%"></div>
          </div>
          <div class="mock-row"><span>2.6L of 4L</span><span class="tabular">65%</span></div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="wellness-cta">
      <button class="btn">Notify me when wellness ships</button>
      <p style="margin-top: 12px; font-size: 12px; color: var(--ph-text-muted);">Built by the team — shipping after the next sprint.</p>
    </div>
  </main>

</body>
</html>
